      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a decent start, it's pretty accurate. But it's a little bit too brief for a study guide. Can you expand on it? Maybe go into the specific phases (prophase, metaphase, etc.) so they actually have something to study.\n\nAnd honestly, the score on that last one was kind of low. It's fine, but if we want these to get flagged as \"high quality\" by our automated system, we probably need a bit more of that instructional language. Just keep it natural, don't make it weird.",
